      "lines": [
        "б) 点$B(7,-3)$在方程$x^2-7x^2y-11xy^3+10x-19y↵+24=0$的图象上吗？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "145",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "145. 作出下列方程的图象：",
        "а) $(x-4)(y-3)=0$； б) $(x-1)(y-x)=0$；",
        "в) $(xy-6)(x+y)=0$； г) $x^2-y^2=0$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "146",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "146. 作出下列方程的图象：",
        "а) $|x|+y=4$； б) $x+|y|=4$；",
        "в) $|x|+|y|=4$； г) $|x|+|y|=x+y$；",
        "д) $|x|y=6$； е) $|xy|=6$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "147",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "147. 作出下列方程的图象：",
        "а) $y=-\\frac{5}{x}$； б) $xy=7.5$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "148",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "148. 作出下列方程的图象：",
        "а) $x^2+y^2=49$； б) $x^2+y^2=48$；",
        "в) $x^2+y^2=42.25$； г) $x^2+y^2=20.25$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "149",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "149. 已知圆周$x^2+y^2=r^2$经过点$A(a,b)$。这个圆周经过下",
        "列各点吗？",
        "$B(-a,b),\\ C(-a,-b),\\ D(a,-b),\\ E(b,a),\\ K(-b,↵a),\\ M(-b,-a)$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "150",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "150. 已知圆周$x^2+y^2=r^2$经过点$A(8,15)$，下列各点相对于",
        "这个圆周是怎样的位置？",
        "$B(7,16)$，$C(9,14)$，$D(-1,12\\sqrt{2})$。"
      ]
    },
